# Purrfect Recall conventions

- Backend: FastAPI + SQLAlchemy + SQLite. Entry: `./scripts/dev.sh` or `uv run uvicorn app.main:app --reload`
- Frontend: static `frontend/index.html` — serve separately, not via FastAPI
- Layering: `app/routes/` → `app/schemas/` → `app/models/` → `study.db`
- Spaced repetition: SM-2 in `app/routes/flashcards.py` (`_schedule_next_review`)
- No backend auth yet; do not assume `/auth` exists
- Prefer minimal diffs; match existing patterns (no framework without request)
- Read `AGENTS.md` and `README.md` before structural changes
